OL,3,GNEWSAMan and two children taken to
OL,4,Ahospital after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo children and a man have been taken
OL,7,Fto hospital after a collision involving
OL,8,Fa car and three pedestrians in an East
OL,9,FSussex village.
OL,11,FPolice said the man and the two
OL,12,Fchildren were taken to hospital with
OL,13,Finjuries after the crash at about 08:30
OL,14,FGMT on the B2240 at The Stream,
OL,15,FCatsfield.
OL,17,FEmergency services remained at the
OL,18,Fscene on Wednesday afternoon and the
OL,19,Froad was closed between Church Road and
OL,20,FWatermill Stream, Sussex Police said.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
